- Classify each as canonical, adapter-backed, ticket-local, generated,
  credential-only, duplicate, or deprecated.
- Define compatibility adapters and migration sequencing.
- Preserve and regression-test existing command behavior before removal.
- Publish migration status for routine terminology, templates, and script
